{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "e7CKJ3v4JS", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Charles Gibson (New York)", "segment_description": null, "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906535, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "A17eryU3V6", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "Campaign 2008 / Biden-Palin Debate", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Tonight's vice presidential debate between Senator Joe Biden and Governor Sarah Palin previewed.  \n\n(St. Louis: Kate Snow)  The background to the debate with the challenges for Palin and Biden featured; scenes shown of Palin and Biden arriving in St. Louis.  [On radio with Sean Hannity, PALIN&nbsp- questions Senator Barack Obama supporting cutting funding for our troops in a war zone.]  ABC News/\"Washington Post\" poll findings on the voters' view on whether Senator John McCain's choice of Palin make you less likely to vote for him cited.  [November 2006, in Alaska gubernatorial debate, PALIN&nbsp- speaks.]  [Former Alaska gubernatorial candidate Eric CROFT&#134;- warns Biden to watch out.]  Senator Claire McCaskill quoted about Biden.  [October 2007, BIDEN&nbsp- jokes about former New York City Mayor Rudolph Giuliani.]  [Democratic strategist Celina LAKE&#134;- outlines the challenge for Biden to win.]  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson, George Stephanopoulos)  The attention on this debate, the need for Palin to turn in a confident performance, the opposing advice to Palin and Biden, the dilemma for Biden and the big news that McCain has decided to pull out of the state of Michigan with more paths to victory noew open for Obama than McCain discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  ABC News coverage of the debate announced. ", "segment_duration": 290, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906536, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "ZbPjrZyw8h", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "Economy: Rescue Package / House Vote", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Stock Market Report.  \n\n(Capitol Hill: Jake Tapper)  The cliffhanger over the House vote tomorrow for the economic rescue package featured.  [North Carolina construction machinery Power Curbers Co. CEO Dyke MESSINGER&#134;- says we were getting no orders; states we want our Congressman to support the package.]  [Speaker of the House Nancy PELOSI&nbsp- says we won't take a bill to the floor without a positive vote.]  Examples of additional provisions to the bill that are turning off Congress listed.  [[Representative Steve LaTOURETTE&#134;- calls for a \"clean bill\" without pork.]  [Representative Steny HOYER&nbsp- worries about the votes.] ", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906537, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "yZe4X7KEYx", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "Campaign 2008 / Obama vs. McCain / Florida", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  50 states in 50 days report re-introduced.   (Orlando: Jeffrey Kofman)  The importance of the issue of the economy in the key voting state of Florida featured; scenes shown from Interstate 4; details given about the growing Hispanic demographic.  [Several FLORIDIANS&nbsp- say \"economy.\"]  [University of Central Florida professor Aubrey JEWETT&#134;- says we are the fastest growing region in Florida.]  [Tomato Express Supermarket owner Stella SIRACUZA&#134;- says the economic downturn is real, so she turned Democrat.]  [Independent voter Bob SHIELDS&#134;- blames the republican Party.]  [Cox's Seafood Faye Ann COX&#134;- worries about retirement.] ", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63490.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906538, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "GV7trzwebt", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "California / Fossett's Plane", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Report introduced.  \n\n(Mammoth Lakes, California: Brian Rooney)  Confirmation in California that worldwide adventurer Steve Fossett's plane and human remains have been found in the mountains a year after he vanished featured; scenes of the mountains in the distance, pictures of the plane and money and identification found by a hiker shown.  [Mono County search and rescue Jutta SCHMIDT&#134;- reviews what happened to the plane.]  [Friend Richard BRANSON&#134;- speculates.] ", "segment_duration": 90, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63630.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906539, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "98Yb3zsZpL", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Charles Gibson)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63720.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906540, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "Worl