 York: Bill Weir)  The return of the refurbished USS Intrepid to New York City's harbor featured; photos shown of the aircraft carrier in World War II and the Vietnam War; details given about the cost of renovations.  [USS Intrepid crew 1943-1946 Joe MURPHY&#134;, USS Intrepid Museum president Bill WHITE&#134;, USS Intrepid commander 1961-1962 R/Adm. James \"Doc\" ABBOT&#134;- comment on the ship.] ", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64540.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906549, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 906535, "segment_id": "2BHAOekGwS", "segment_broadcast_id": "Yz4Z3q2uwB", "segment_title": "Good Night", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64680.0", "legacy_segment_id": 906550, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}]}